  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. ABJM point, L = 2 pairs, diagonal twist with $z_2=z_3$: the three operators and the calibration on $\\langle W_a^2|$\n\n$X_1=t_1(\\theta_{F,1})$, $X_2=t_2(\\theta_{F,1}+h)$, $X_3=\\hat t_3(\\theta_{F,1}+h)$ as exact sparse $256\\times256$ matrices; $K_\\kappa=s^2+\\kappa s[X_1/(h^2\\lambda_1)+X_2/(2h^4y\\lambda_2)+X_3/(6h^5y^2\\lambda_3)]+\\kappa^2X_3X_1/(24h^7y^2\\lambda_1\\lambda_3)$, $s=1-\\kappa(z_1+z_4)$. Calibration: $\\langle W_a^2|K_\\kappa=(1-\\kappa z_1)^2\\langle W_{a'}\\otimes W_a|$, $a'=a(1-\\kappa z_4)/(1-\\kappa z_1)$ [exact].",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raThF = {-3/5, -11/8, -7/9};\nraTh = {raThF[[1]] + 1, raThF[[1]], raThF[[2]] + 1, raThF[[2]]};\nraTypes = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"};\nraY = 5/4; raZ = {3/2, raY, raY, 4/7}; raG = DiagonalMatrix[raZ];\nraU1 = raTh[[2]]; raU2 = raTh[[2]] + rah;\nraL1 = raLam[1, raU1, Drop[raTh, 2]]; raL2 = raLam[2, raU2, Drop[raTh, 2]]; raL3 = raLam[3, raU2, Drop[raTh, 2]];\nraTiming = AbsoluteTiming[raM1 = raT[1, raU1, raTypes, raTh, raG]; raM2 = raT[2, raU2, raTypes, raTh, raG]; raM3 = raT[3, raU2, raTypes, raTh, raG, True];][[1]];\nraWords[ref_] := Module[{x1, x2, x3, x31}, x1 = ref . raM1; x2 = ref . raM2; x3 = ref . raM3; x31 = x3 . raM1; {ref, x1, x2, x3, x31}];\nraKcoef[kap_] := With[{s = 1 - kap (raZ[[1]] + raZ[[4]])}, {s^2, kap s/(rah^2 raL1), kap s/(2 rah^4 raY raL2), kap s/(6 rah^5 raY^2 raL3), kap^2/(24 rah^7 raY^2 raL1 raL3)}];\nraK[kap_, ws_] := raKcoef[kap] . ws;\nraCalib = Module[{a = 1/3, ws, ap, tgt}, ws = raWords[raProd[Join[raW[a], raW[a]]]];\n   Table[ap = a (1 - kap raZ[[4]])/(1 - kap raZ[[1]]); tgt = (1 - kap raZ[[1]])^2 raProd[Join[raW[ap], raW[a]]];\n    {kap, ap, raK[kap, ws] == tgt}, {kap, {3/10, -7/5, 1/raZ[[4]]}}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"build time (s)\", raTiming, \"\"}, {\"lambda1, lambda2, lambda3\", {raL1, raL2, raL3}, \"\"}, {\"kappa\", \"a'\", \"<W_a^2| K_kappa == (1 - kappa z1)^2 <W_a' (x) W_a| (exact)\"}}, raCalib], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"35\" data-out-n=\"170\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[170]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.2653em;vertical-align:-3.3627em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9027em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.8627em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.8627em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2253em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.3627em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.8627em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.0227em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">build time (s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.8127em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lambda1, lambda2, lambda3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6127em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kappa</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4076em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.2024em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=