  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Pair-level reduction and the test function\n\nBy the column-support lemma every localising word on a product reference $(v\\otimes u)^{\\otimes L}$ ($v\\cdot u=0$, i.e. any global rotation of the vacuum) equals $\\lambda_w\\times$(the same word on the 1-pair chain) $\\otimes(v\\otimes u)^{\\otimes(L-1)}$. We verify this exactly at $L=2$ on a random BPS reference and then work with the $16\\times16$ one-pair operators $P_1=t_1(\\theta_F)$, $P_2=t_2(\\theta_F+h)$, $P_3=\\hat t_3(\\theta_F+h)$ (one pair, $\\theta=(2h,0)$, $G=\\mathrm{diag}(z_1,y,y,z_4)$).\n\n**Test** for a reference $(v,u)$: the five pair bras $\\{r, rP_1, rP_2, rP_3, rP_3P_1\\}$, $r=v\\otimes u$; target $T_\\kappa=[v(1-\\kappa\\Lambda)]\\otimes[u(1-\\kappa\\Lambda)^{-1}]$; exact ranks of the span with/without $T_\\kappa$ at $\\kappa\\in\\{3/10,-7/5,1/z_4\\}$; coefficients when it lies in the span.\n\n**$\\kappa$-components.** With $z_2=z_3=y$ the spectral classes are $C_1=\\{1\\}$, $C_2=\\{2,3\\}$, $C_4=\\{4\\}$ and $T_\\kappa=\\sum_{a,b}\\frac{1-\\kappa z_a}{1-\\kappa z_b}\\,v|_{C_a}\\otimes u|_{C_b}$. The seven functions $1$ and $\\frac{1-\\kappa z_a}{1-\\kappa z_b}$ ($a\\neq b$) are linearly independent, so **$T_\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{span}$ for all $\\kappa$ iff each of the seven components $D=\\sum_a v|_a\\otimes u|_a$, $B_{ab}=v|_a\\otimes u|_b$ ($a\\ne b$) lies in the 5-dim span**. In particular at most 5 of them may be nonzero: a reference with $v$ and $u$ both supported on all three classes (7 nonzero components) can never admit a $\\kappa$-family.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raZp = {raZ[[1]], raY, raY, raZ[[4]]}; raGp = DiagonalMatrix[raZp];\nraP1 = Normal[raT[1, 0, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, raGp]]; raP2 = Normal[raT[2, rah, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, raGp]]; raP3 = Normal[raT[3, rah, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, raGp, True]];\nraPairWords[v_, u_] := Module[{r = raProd[{v, u}]}, {r, r . raP1, r . raP2, r . raP3, r . raP3 . raP1}];\nraLamW = {1, raL1, raL2, raL3, raL3 raL1};\nraFullCheck[v_, u_] := Module[{ref = raProd[{v, u, v, u}], rest = raProd[{v, u}], ws, pw, sp},\n   ws = raWords[ref]; pw = raPairWords[v, u];\n   sp = raSplit[#, rest] & /@ ws;\n   {AllTrue[sp, AllTrue[Flatten[#[[2]]], TrueQ[Together[#] == 0] &] &], And @@ Table[Together[sp[[i, 1]] - raLamW[[i]] pw[[i]]] == ConstantArray[0, 16], {i, 5}]}];\nraV0 = {1, 2, -1, 3}; raU0 = {2, 1/2, 1, 1}; raU0 = raU0 - (raV0 . raU0)/(raV0 . raV0) raV0;\nraClasses = {{1}, {2, 3}, {4}};\nraMask[c_] := Table[Boole[MemberQ[c, j]], {j, 4}];\nraComponents[v_, u_] := Module[{vc = Table[v raMask[c], {c, raClasses}], uc = Table[u raMask[c], {c, raClasses}]},\n   Join[{Sum[raProd[{vc[[a]], uc[[a]]}], {a, 3}]}, Flatten[Table[If[a == b, Nothing, raProd[{vc[[a]], uc[[b]]}]], {a, 3}, {b, 3}], 1]]];\nraCompNames = {\"D\", \"B12\", \"B14\", \"B21\", \"B24\", \"B41\", \"B42\"};\n(* polynomial target: T = [v(1-kap Lambda)] (x) [u adj(1-kap Lambda)] = prod_m(1-kap z_m) x the rational target; on W_a: K_kappa W_a = T/(1-kap y)^2 *)\nraTarget[v_, u_, kap_] := raProd[{v (1 - kap raZp), u Table[Product[If[m == j, 1, 1 - kap raZp[[m]]], {m, 4}], {j, 4}]}];\nraKaps = {3/10, -7/5, 1/raZ[[4]]};\nraTest[v_, u_] := Module[{pw = raPairWords[v, u], rk, rkT, comps, nz, inSpan, sol, cs, ok},\n   rk = MatrixRank[pw];\n   rkT = Table[MatrixRank[Append[pw, raTarget[v, u, kap]]], {kap, raKaps}];\n   comps = raComponents[v, u];\n   nz = Boole[AnyTrue[#, # =!= 0 &]] & /@ comps;\n   inSpan = Table[If[nz[[i]] == 0, \"0\", MatrixRank[Append[pw, comps[[i]]]] == rk], {i, 7}];\n   ok = AllTrue[rkT, # == rk &];\n   cs = If[ok, Module[{c = Array[raC, 5], s, kap = raKaps[[1]]}, s = Solve[Thread[Together[c . pw - raTarget[v, u, kap]/(1 - kap raY)^2] == 0], c]; If[s === {}, \"none\", Factor[c /. First[s]]]], \"-\"];\n   {rk, rkT, Total[nz], inSpan, ok, cs}];\nraHead = {\"reference\", \"v\", \"u\", \"rank span\", \"rank span+T_kappa (3 kappas)\", \"# nonzero kappa-components\", \"components in span (D,B12,B14,B21,B24,B41,B42)\", \"K-family exists\", \"coefficients at kappa=3/10 (target T/(1-kap y)^2; W_a: = raKcoef raLamW)\"};\nraRow[name_, v_, u_] := Join[{name, v, u}, raTest[v, u]];\nGrid[{{\"v.u = 0 for the random BPS reference\", raV0 . raU0 == 0}, {\"L = 2 full chain: all 5 words localise on pair 1; pair-1 vector = lambda_w x (1-pair word)\", raFullCheck[raV0, raU0]},\n  {\"same on W_a (a = 1/3)\", raFullCheck[raW[1/3][[1]], raW[1/3][[2]]]}, {\"K_kappa coefficients of the calibration, pair level (W_a, kappa = 3/10): raKcoef x raLamW\", raKcoef[3/10] raLamW},\n  {\"raTest on W_a (a = 1/3): must reproduce these coefficients\", raTest[raW[1/3][[1]], raW[1/3][[2]]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
