      {
       "data": "Out[206]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{v (Levi representative)} & \\text{u (v.u = 0 solved)} & \\text{generic rank of the 5-word span} & \\text{condition for each nonzero kappa-component to be in the span} & \\text{all together = admissible locus}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,0,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{-\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right)-\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(4\\right),\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right),\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(3\\right),\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(4\\right)\\right\\} & 5 & \\begin{matrix}\\text{D}\\text{: }\\left(\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(4\\right)==0\\right)\\lor \\left(\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(3\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(4\\right)==0\\right)\\\\\\text{B12}\\text{: }\\left(\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(3\\right)==0\\right)\\lor \\left(\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(4\\right)==0\\right)\\lor \\left(\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(3\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(4\\right)==0\\right)\\\\\\text{B14}\\text{: }\\left(\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(4\\right)==0\\right)\\lor \\left(\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(3\\right)==0\\land \\mathrm{raUs}\\left(4\\right)==0\\right)\\lor \\left(\\mathrm{raUs}\\left(2\\right)==0\\lan… [latex truncated: 9506 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
