  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5d. Extra machinery: generic-z pair words, κ-components, residuals\n\n`raPairWordsZ[v,u,zz]` = the five pair words on the one-pair chain with diagonal twist `zz` (any z, not only z₂=z₃); `raTargetZ` = $T_\\kappa=[v(1-\\kappa\\Lambda)]\\otimes[u\\,\\mathrm{adj}(1-\\kappa\\Lambda)]$ (polynomial normalisation); `raKapComps` = the 13 $\\kappa$-components $D=\\sum_a v_a e_a\\otimes u_ae_a$, $B_{ab}=v_ae_a\\otimes u_be_b$; `raResid` = relative least-squares distance of $T_\\kappa$ from the 5-word span (80-digit), optionally restricted to a mask of the 16 pair components (charged sector = components $(a,b)$, $a\\ne b$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raMask1[j_] := UnitVector[4, j];\n(* no memoisation (shared-kernel memory rule) *)\nraPairOps[zz_] := With[{G = DiagonalMatrix[zz]}, {Normal[raT[1, 0, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G]], Normal[raT[2, rah, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G]], Normal[raT[3, rah, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G, True]]}];\nraPairWordsZ[v_, u_, zz_] := Module[{r = raProd[{v, u}], o = raPairOps[zz]}, {r, r . o[[1]], r . o[[2]], r . o[[3]], r . o[[3]] . o[[1]]}];\nraTargetZ[v_, u_, kap_, zz_] := raProd[{v (1 - kap zz), u Table[Product[If[m == j, 1, 1 - kap zz[[m]]], {m, 4}], {j, 4}]}];\nraKapComps[v_, u_] := Join[{Total[Table[raProd[{v raMask1[j], u raMask1[j]}], {j, 4}]]}, Flatten[Table[If[a == b, Nothing, raProd[{v raMask1[a], u raMask1[b]}]], {a, 4}, {b, 4}], 1]];\nraChg = Flatten[Table[Boole[a != b], {a, 4}, {b, 4}]];\nraResid[v_, u_, kap_, zz_, mask_: ConstantArray[1, 16]] := Module[{pw = N[raPairWordsZ[v, u, zz], 80] Table[mask, 5], T = N[raTargetZ[v, u, kap, zz], 80] mask, c, res},\n   If[T . T == 0, Return[0]];\n   c = LeastSquares[Transpose[pw], T]; res = T - c . pw; N[Sqrt[Abs[res . Conjugate[res]]/Abs[T . Conjugate[T]]], 6]];\n{\"consistency z2=z3: raPairWordsZ == raPairWords\", raPairWordsZ[raW[1/3][[1]], raW[1/3][[2]], raZp] == raPairWords[raW[1/3][[1]], raW[1/3][[2]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"42\" data-out-n=\"227\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"18\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[227]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsZWZ0XHtcdGV4dHtjb25zaXN0ZW5jeSB6Mj16MzogcmFQYWlyV29yZHNaID09IHJhUGFpcldvcmRzfSBccmlnaHQuIFxcCiAgJlxsZWZ0LiAsXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9ClxlbmR7YWxpZ25lZH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">consistency z2=z3: raPairWordsZ == raPairWords</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[227]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{consistency z2=z3: raPairWordsZ == raPairWords} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "6615570f-f242-4bbc-9acd-23889800922f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5e. Why: the five words are diagonal on the charged weight sectors, with five explicit eigenvalue functions\n\nThe words commute with the Cartan torus of $GL(4)$ (diagonal twist), so on the 12 charged pair states $e_a\\otimes e_b$ ($a\\neq b$; weight $e_a-e_b$, one-dimensional sectors) each word is a number. With $\\sigma=\\sum z_j$, $\\det=\\prod z_j$ and normalised words $x_1=X_1/2h^2$, $x_2=-X_2/2h^4$, $x_3=X_3/12h^5$ the eigenvalues are\n$$x_1\\to z_b,\\qquad x_2\\to z_b(\\sigma-z_a-z_b),\\qquad x_3\\to \\det/z_a,\\qquad x_3x_1\\to \\det\\, z_b/z_a$$\n(checked symbolically below). A reference $v\\otimes u$ whose charged support $S=\\{(a,b):a\\ne b,\\;v_au_b\\neq0\\}$ has $|S|$ elements can only be mapped to a vector with prescribed charged components by the 5-parameter family $\\sum_wc_w\\,\\text{word}_w$ if the $|S|\\times5$ evaluation matrix has rank $|S|$; a $\\kappa$-family needs the unit vectors $e_{ab}$, $(a,b)\\in S$, in the span, i.e. $\\mathrm{rank}=|S|$. For a generic reference at generic $z$: $|S|=12>5$, impossible. At $z_2=z_3$ the sectors fuse into classes and the count is by class pairs.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raZs = Array[raZsym, 4];\nraOpsS = With[{G = DiagonalMatrix[raZs]}, {Normal[raT[1, 0, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G]], Normal[raT[2, rah, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G]], Normal[raT[3, rah, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G, True]]}];\nraXn = {raOpsS[[1]]/(2 rah^2), -raOpsS[[2]]/(2 rah^4), raOpsS[[3]]/(12 rah^5)};\nraSig = Total[raZs]; raDt = Times @@ raZs;\nraPredEig = {Function[{a, b}, raZs[[b]]], Function[{a, b}, raZs[[b]] (raSig - raZs[[a]] - raZs[[b]])], Function[{a, b}, raDt/raZs[[a]]]};\nraEigRow[a_, b_] := Module[{r = raProd[{raUV[a], raUV[b]}], idx = (a - 1) 4 + b}, Table[Module[{s = r . raXn[[k]]}, {Simplify[s - s[[idx]] r] === ConstantArray[0, 16], Simplify[s[[idx]] - raPredEig[[k]][a, b]] === 0}], {k, 3}]];\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[If[a == b, Nothing, {a, b, raEigRow[a, b]}], {a, 4}, {b, 4}], 1], {\"a\", \"b\", \"{e_a(x)e_b is an eigenvector, eigenvalue == prediction} for x1, x2, x3 (symbolic z, exact)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"43\" data-out-n=\"234\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[234]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:44.4402em;vertical-align:-21.9501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:22.4901em;\"><span style=\"top:-24.4501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:24.4501em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:44.4002em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-21.9501em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:22.4501em;\"><span style=\"top:-25.6601em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-23.2501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.6501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.0501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</