  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5f. Near the degeneration: residual of the best 5-word fit in the untwisting scaling ($z=1+\\varepsilon\\varphi$, $w=1+\\varepsilon\\omega$, $\\kappa=1-c\\varepsilon$, $z_2-z_3=\\varepsilon\\,\\Delta\\varphi$)\n\nRelative least-squares distance of $T_\\kappa$ from the span of the five words (80-digit), for the formal twisted vacuum and for $W_a$, on all 16 pair components and on the charged components only. $\\varphi=(9/10,7/20,7/20+\\Delta\\varphi,-11/10)$, $\\omega=(7/10,-3/10,1/5,1/2)$, $c=4/5$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raScal = Flatten[Table[Module[{ep = 10^-e, phi = {9/10, 7/20, 7/20 + dl, -11/10}, om = {7/10, -3/10, 1/5, 1/2}, cc = 4/5, zz, ww, f, v, u, kap, wv, wu},\n   zz = 1 + ep phi; ww = 1 + ep om; kap = 1 - cc ep; f = raTwVacForm[ww, zz]; v = f[[1]]; u = f[[2]]; {wv, wu} = raW[1/3];\n   {N[dl], e, raResid[v, u, kap, zz], raResid[v, u, kap, zz, raChg], raResid[wv, wu, kap, zz], raResid[wv, wu, kap, zz, raChg]}], {dl, {1/100, 1/10, 1/2}}, {e, {2, 3, 4}}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[raScal, {\"Delta phi\", \"eps = 10^-e, e\", \"tw. vac.: all comps\", \"tw. vac.: charged only\", \"W_a: all comps\", \"W_a: charged only\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
