   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. GL(4) covariance: admissibility as a condition on the conjugated twist $G'$\n\n$\\langle\\mathrm{vac}|\\rho(g)\\,X[t^\\Lambda]=\\langle\\mathrm{vac}|\\,X[t^{G'}]\\,\\rho(g)$ for any word $X$ (bra action $A$: $v\\to vg$, $F$: $u\\to ug^{-T}$, $\\rho(g)=g\\otimes g^{-T}$; $t^{G'}$ the transfer matrix with non-diagonal twist). The first cell below determines $G'$ exactly: **$G'=g^{-T}\\Lambda g^{T}=(g\\Lambda g^{-1})^T$** (python/exact result of 2026-10-13; the other three candidates fail). Put $\\tilde G=g\\Lambda g^{-1}=G'^T$. Since $T_\\kappa=\\langle\\mathrm{vac}|\\rho(g(1-\\kappa\\Lambda))=\\langle\\mathrm{vac}|\\rho(1-\\kappa\\tilde G)\\rho(g)$, 'K is a common rotation on $\\langle\\mathrm{vac}|\\rho(g)$' is equivalent to '$\\langle\\mathrm{vac}|K[G']\\propto\\langle\\mathrm{vac}|\\rho(1-\\kappa G'^T)$', a statement about the **lower-triangular twist $G'$ with spectrum $z$** (for upper-triangular $g$). For $v=e_1g$, $u=e_4g^{-T}$ one has $uf(\\Lambda)v^T=[f(G')]_{41}$, so the block condition of §5c reads $[G'^n]_{41}=0$ for $n=1,2,3$; the W-type is $G'=\\Lambda+cE_{41}$ (one off-diagonal entry).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {
    "toolId": "X32sZmlsZQ"
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raGt = {{2, 1/3, -1, 2}, {0, 1, 3/2, 1/5}, {0, 0, 5/3, -2}, {0, 0, 0, 3/4}};\nraCovTab = Module[{g = raGt, Lam = DiagonalMatrix[raZg], th = {2/7, -3/5}, x = 37/100, Rg, cands},\n   Rg = KroneckerProduct[g, Inverse[Transpose[g]]];\n   cands = <|\"g^-1 L g\" -> Inverse[g] . Lam . g, \"g L g^-1\" -> g . Lam . Inverse[g], \"g^T L g^-T\" -> Transpose[g] . Lam . Inverse[Transpose[g]], \"g^-T L g^T\" -> Inverse[Transpose[g]] . Lam . Transpose[g]|>;\n   Table[Prepend[Table[Rg . Normal[raT[k, x, {\"A\", \"F\"}, th, Lam]] . Inverse[Rg] == Normal[raT[k, x, {\"A\", \"F\"}, th, cands[name]]], {name, Keys[cands]}], k], {k, 1, 3}]];\nGrid[Prepend[raCovTab, {\"k\", \"rho(g) t_k^Lambda rho(g)^-1 == t_k^{G'} with G' = g^-1 Lam g\", \"G' = g Lam g^-1\", \"G' = g^T Lam g^-T\", \"G' = g^-T Lam g^T\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"46\" data-out-n=\"244\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"25\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[244]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\"