  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Full identity at L = 3 pairs (6 sites, 4096-dim) for the new passing families [exact mod p]\n\nWord action on a bra by site-by-site contraction (no 4096x4096 matrices), exact modulo the prime $p=$ `raP` ($\\approx3.4\\cdot10^7$; false-positive probability $\\sim p^{-1}$ per component, 4096 components). Checks, per reference $(v\\otimes u)^{\\otimes3}$: (i) every word equals $\\lambda_w\\,$(pair-1 word)$\\,\\otimes(v\\otimes u)^{\\otimes2}$ (localisation); (ii) $\\sum_w (c_w/\\lambda_w)\\,\\psi\\cdot w=\\frac{T_\\kappa}{(1-\\kappa y)^2}\\otimes(v\\otimes u)^{\\otimes2}$ with $c_w$ the pair-level coefficients (free ones set to 0), $\\lambda_w$ for pairs 2..3, for $\\kappa\\in\\{3/10,-7/5,1/z_4\\}$. Validation of the contraction code against the matrix code at L = 2 first.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raP = NextPrime[2^25, -1];\nraMod[x_] := Mod[Numerator[x] PowerMod[Denominator[x], -1, raP], raP];\nraModA[a_] := Map[raMod, a, {-1}];\nraThF3 = {-3/5, -11/8, -7/9};\nraTh3 = Flatten[Table[{raThF3[[n]] + 1, raThF3[[n]]}, {n, 3}]];\nraTypes3 = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"};\nraLaxBlocks[k_, ty_, u_, t_] := Module[{lx = raLax[k, ty, u, t], n = Binomial[4, k]}, Table[raModA[Normal[lx[[m, j]]]], {m, n}, {j, n}]];\nraActS[vec_, s_, nn_, M_] := Module[{A = 4^(s - 1), B = 4^(nn - s), t}, t = Transpose[ArrayReshape[vec, {A, 4, B}], {1, 3, 2}] . M; Mod[Flatten[Transpose[t, {1, 3, 2}]], raP]];\nraApplyP[k_, u_, types_, th_, G_, reg_, psi_] := Module[{n = Binomial[4, k], nn = Length[types], Phi, lb, wG, pref, zero = ConstantArray[0, 4^Length[types]]},\n   Phi = Table[If[i == j, psi, zero], {i, n}, {j, n}];\n   Do[lb = raLaxBlocks[k, types[[s]], u, th[[s]]];\n    Phi = Table[Mod[Total[Table[If[AllTrue[Flatten[lb[[m, j]]], # == 0 &], zero, raActS[Phi[[i, m]], s, nn, lb[[m, j]]]], {m, n}]], raP], {i, n}, {j, n}], {s, nn}];\n   wG = raModA[Minors[G, k]]; pref = raMod[Times @@ Table[raGfac[types[[s]], k, u, th[[s]], reg], {s, nn}]];\n   Mod[pref Total[Flatten[Table[wG[[j, i]] Phi[[i, j]], {i, n}, {j, n}], 1]], raP]];\nraWordsP[psi_, types_, th_, G_] := Module[{u1 = th[[2]], u2 = th[[2]] + rah, x1, x2, x3, x31},\n   x1 = raApplyP[1, u1, types, th, G, False, psi]; x2 = raApplyP[2, u2, types, th, G, False, psi]; x3 = raApplyP[3, u2, types, th, G, True, psi]; x31 = raApplyP[1, u1, types, th, G, False, x3];\n   {psi, x1, x2, x3, x31}];\n(* validation at L = 2 against the matrix code *)\nraVal2 = Table[Module[{ref = raProd[{p[[1]], p[[2]], p[[1]], p[[2]]}]}, raWordsP[raModA[ref], raTypes, raTh, raG] === raModA[Normal /@ raWords[ref]]], {p, {raW[1/3], {raV0, raU0}}}];\n{raP, raVal2}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"53\" data-out-n=\"302\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"28\" data-sub-start=\"19\" data-sub-end=\"19\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[302]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezMzNTU0MzkzLFxsZWZ0XHtcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9LFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX1ccmlnaHRcfVxyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">33554393</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[302]= \\left\\{33554393,\\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
