       "data": "Out[320]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{reference (v (x) u)\\^{}3} & \\text{5 words localise on pair 1 (word = lambda\\_w x pair-word (x) rest)} & \\text{sum\\_w c\\_w/lambda\\_w <psi|w == T\\_kappa/(1-kappa y)\\^{}2 (x) rest   for kappa = 3/10, -7/5, 1/z4}\\\\\\hline\\text{W\\_a, a = 1/3} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{<0\\_w| at z2=z3 (limit), generic w: v = (0,1,-1,0), u = u\\_w} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{<0\\_w| limit, w1 = z1 locus: v = e1, u = u\\_w} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{<0|\\_comp limit: (0,1,-1,0) (x) (1,1,1,1)} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{R2: v = (1,2,3,0), u = (0,3,-2,5)} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{Tr… [latex truncated: 2094 chars total]",
