  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Untwisting limit of the rotated pair 1\n\n$z=1+\\varepsilon\\varphi$, $w=1+\\varepsilon\\omega$, $\\kappa=1-c\\varepsilon$: then $1-\\kappa z_j=\\varepsilon(c-\\varphi_j)+O(\\varepsilon^2)$, so $T_\\kappa\\to(\\hat vD)\\otimes(\\hat uD^{-1})$ with $D=\\mathrm{diag}(c-\\varphi_j)$ (**sign: $c-\\varphi_j$, not $c+\\varphi_j$, for $\\kappa=1-c\\varepsilon$**). For the twisted vacuum at generic $\\varphi$: $\\hat v_j=\\prod_{m\\ne j}(\\omega_1-\\varphi_m)/(\\varphi_j-\\varphi_m)$, $\\hat u_j=\\prod_{m\\le3}(\\varphi_j-\\omega_m)$. At the ABJM-point twist $\\varphi_2=\\varphi_3$ the factor $1/(\\varphi_2-\\varphi_3)$ makes $\\hat v\\to(0,1,-1,0)$ (after normalisation). Numerical check (exact rationals, normalised vectors; deviation = $\\|\\hat T-\\hat T_{\\rm pred}\\|$ at $\\varepsilon=10^{-2..-5}$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raUntw[ep_, phi_, om_, cc_] := Module[{zz = 1 + ep phi, ww = 1 + ep om, kap = 1 - cc ep, f, v, u, T, nrm, vh, uh, devs},\n   f = raTwVacForm[ww, zz]; v = f[[1]]; u = f[[2]]; T = raProd[{v (1 - kap zz), u/(1 - kap zz)}];\n   nrm[x_] := x/Sqrt[x . x];\n   vh = Table[Product[If[m == j, 1, (om[[1]] - phi[[m]])/(phi[[j]] - phi[[m]])], {m, 4}], {j, 4}]; uh = Table[Product[phi[[j]] - om[[m]], {m, 3}], {j, 4}];\n   devs = Table[Module[{Tp = raProd[{vh (cc + s phi), uh/(cc + s phi)}]}, Min[Norm[N[nrm[T] - nrm[Tp], 20]], Norm[N[nrm[T] + nrm[Tp], 20]]]], {s, {-1, 1}}];\n   N[devs, 5]];\nraUntwTab1 = Table[{e, raUntw[10^-e, {9/10, 7/20, 7/10, -11/10}, {7/10, -3/10, 1/5, 1/2}, 4/5]}, {e, 2, 5}];\nGrid[Prepend[raUntwTab1, {\"eps = 10^-e\", \"generic phi (phi2 != phi3): deviation from (vhat D) (x) (uhat D^-1) for D = c - phi | D = c + phi\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"56\" data-out-n=\"323\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"31\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[323]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eps = 10</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-e</span></span></spa