  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Which infinitesimal group rotations lie in the span? (item (d))\n\nFor a reference $r=v\\otimes u$ the tangent vectors of its $GL(4)$ orbit are $r\\rho(E_{ij})$ with $\\rho(E_{ij})=E_{ij}\\otimes1-1\\otimes E_{ji}$. We compute $\\mathfrak h_r=\\{X\\in\\mathfrak{gl}_4:\\ r\\rho(X)\\in\\mathrm{span}\\{r,rX_1,rX_2,rX_3,rX_3X_1\\}\\}$ (exact), its dimension modulo the stabiliser $\\mathfrak{s}_r=\\{X:r\\rho(X)=0\\}$, and the torus-orbit test for several functions $f(\\Lambda)$: is $[vf(\\Lambda)]\\otimes[uf(\\Lambda)^{-1}]$ in the span?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raRhoE[i_, j_] := KroneckerProduct[raEg[i, j], raI4] - KroneckerProduct[raI4, raEg[j, i]];\nraXstr[x_] := Total[Table[If[x[[(i - 1) 4 + j]] =!= 0, x[[(i - 1) 4 + j]] raEE[i, j], 0], {i, 4}, {j, 4}], 2];\nraTang[v_, u_] := Module[{r = raProd[{v, u}], pw = raPairWords[v, u], tg, ns, h, stab, quo, cur},\n   tg = Flatten[Table[{r . raRhoE[i, j]}, {i, 4}, {j, 4}], 1][[All, 1]];\n   ns = NullSpace[Transpose[Join[tg, -pw]]]; h = RowReduce[ns[[All, 1 ;; 16]]]; h = Select[h, # =!= ConstantArray[0, 16] &];\n   stab = NullSpace[Transpose[tg]];\n   cur = stab; quo = {};\n   Do[If[MatrixRank[Append[cur, x]] > MatrixRank[cur], AppendTo[quo, x]; AppendTo[cur, x]], {x, h}];\n   {MatrixRank[tg], Length[stab], Length[h], Length[quo], raXstr /@ quo}];\nraFs = {\"Lambda\" -> raZp, \"Lambda^-1\" -> 1/raZp, \"1 - kappa Lambda^-1 (kappa=3/10)\" -> (1 - 3/10/raZp), \"Lambda^2\" -> raZp^2, \"generic f=(2,5,5,-3)\" -> {2, 5, 5, -3}};\nraTorusTest[v_, u_] := Module[{pw = raPairWords[v, u], rk}, rk = MatrixRank[pw]; Table[MatrixRank[Append[pw, raProd[{v f, u/f}]]] == rk, {f, Values[raFs]}]];\nraTangRefs = {{\"W_a (a=1/3)\", raW[1/3][[1]], raW[1/3][[2]]}, {\"R2: v=(1,2,3,0), u=(0,3,-2,5)\", {1, 2, 3, 0}, {0, 3, -2, 5}}, {\"R5: v=e1, u=(0,2,3,5)\", {1, 0, 0, 0}, {0, 2, 3, 5}}, {\"<0_w| limit: (0,1,-1,0) (x) u_w\", raTw, raTwVacForm[raWw, raZp][[2]]}, {\"R6: v=(0,2,3,0), u=(1,3,-2,4)\", {0, 2, 3, 0}, {1, 3, -2, 4}}, {\"random BPS (not admissible)\", raV0, raU0}};\nGrid[Prepend[Table[Join[{r[[1]], MatrixRank[raPairWords[r[[2]], r[[3]]]]}, raTang[r[[2]], r[[3]]], {raTorusTest[r[[2]], r[[3]]]}], {r, raTangRefs}], {\"reference\", \"rank span\", \"dim orbit tangent\", \"dim stabiliser\", \"dim h_r\", \"dim h_r / stabiliser\", \"representatives of h_r mod stabiliser\", \"torus-orbit test, f = \" <> StringRiffle[Keys[raFs], \"; \"]}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">2 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Power::infy: Infinite expression - encountered.                                  0</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Power::infy: Infinite expression - encountered.                                  0</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
