  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9b. Generic $z$ ($z_2\\ne z_3$): which references and which twisted-vacuum loci admit a $\\kappa$-family\n\nWords and reference at the same generic $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3,4/7)$. (i) All zero patterns (supports of $v$, $u$) with generic rational values on the support and $v\\cdot u=0$ imposed; (ii) the twisted vacuum $\\langle0_w|$ (formal generic-$z$ image) on loci of $w$. Expected from the exact python run (`genericz.py`, `twloci_generic.py`): admissible patterns = disjoint supports ($v_ju_j=0\\ \\forall j$); twisted vacuum admissible iff $w_1\\in\\{z_a\\}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raOkZ[v_, u_, zz_] := Module[{o = raPairOps[zz], r = raProd[{v, u}], pw, rk},\n   pw = {r, r . o[[1]], r . o[[2]], r . o[[3]], r . o[[3]] . o[[1]]}; rk = MatrixRank[pw];\n   AllTrue[{3/10, -7/5, 1/zz[[4]]}, MatrixRank[Append[pw, raTargetZ[v, u, #, zz]]] == rk &]];\nSeedRandom[7];\nraRndNZ[] := RandomInteger[{1, 9}] RandomChoice[{-1, 1}]/RandomInteger[{1, 5}];\nraSampPat[Sv_, Su_] := Module[{v, u, common, j},\n   v = Table[If[MemberQ[Sv, i], raRndNZ[], 0], {i, 4}]; u = Table[If[MemberQ[Su, i], raRndNZ[], 0], {i, 4}];\n   common = Intersection[Sv, Su];\n   If[Length[common] == 1, Return[None]];\n   If[Length[common] >= 2, j = First[common]; u[[j]] = u[[j]] - (v . u)/v[[j]]; If[u[[j]] == 0, Return[None]]];\n   {v, u}];\nraPatRes = Flatten[Table[Module[{s = raSampPat[Sv, Su]}, If[s === None || s[[1]] . s[[2]] =!= 0, Nothing, {Sv, Su, raOkZ[s[[1]], s[[2]], raZg]}]], {Sv, Rest[Subsets[Range[4]]]}, {Su, Rest[Subsets[Range[4]]]}], 1];\nraAdmPat = Select[raPatRes, #[[3]] &];\n{\"patterns tested\", Length[raPatRes], \"admissible\", Length[raAdmPat], \"all admissible patterns have disjoint supports\", AllTrue[raAdmPat, Intersection[#[[1]], #[[2]]] === {} &], \"all disjoint-support patterns admissible\", AllTrue[Select[raPatRes, Intersection[#[[1]], #[[2]]] === {} &], #[[3]] &]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
