  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9c. The A-frozen operator $K^F_\\kappa$ and the $W_a$ operator: symbolic check in $z_1,y,z_4,\\kappa$ (exact)\n\nPair-level words with $\\Lambda=\\mathrm{diag}(z_1,y,y,z_4)$ symbolic. (i) $W_a$: $r\\cdot K_\\kappa=T_\\kappa/(1-\\kappa y)^2$ with the five-word $K_\\kappa$; (ii) A-frozen class $v=(0,1,-1,0)$, $u=(u_1,u_2,u_2,u_4)$ symbolic: $r\\cdot K^F_\\kappa=T_\\kappa/(1-\\kappa y)^2$ with $K^F_\\kappa=[1-\\kappa e_1'+\\kappa^2e_2']+2\\kappa X_1+8\\kappa^2X_2$, $e_1'=z_1+y+z_4$, $e_2'=yz_1+yz_4+z_1z_4$, $X_3,X_3X_1$ not needed; (iii) the fixed-coefficient $K_\\kappa$ of $W_a$ does **not** rotate the A-frozen class.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "raSym = Module[{z1, y, z4, kp, u1, u2, u4, a, G, X1, X2, X3, r, tgt, ks, kF, tg, rW, tW, e1p, e2p, s, kW},\n   G = DiagonalMatrix[{z1, y, y, z4}];\n   X1 = Normal[raT[1, 0, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G]]; X2 = Normal[raT[2, rah, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G]]; X3 = Normal[raT[3, rah, {\"A\", \"F\"}, {1, 0}, G, True]];\n   tg[v_, u_] := raProd[{v (1 - kp {z1, y, y, z4}), u Table[Product[If[m == j, 1, 1 - kp {z1, y, y, z4}[[m]]], {m, 4}], {j, 4}]}]/(1 - kp y)^2;\n   s = 1 - kp (z1 + z4);\n   kW[r_] := s^2 r + kp s/rah^2 r . X1 + kp s/(2 rah^4 y) r . X2 + kp s/(6 rah^5 y^2) r . X3 + kp^2/(24 rah^7 y^2) r . X3 . X1;\n   e1p = z1 + y + z4; e2p = y z1 + y z4 + z1 z4;\n   kF[r_] := (1 - kp e1p + kp^2 e2p) r + 2 kp r . X1 + 8 kp^2 r . X2;\n   rW = raProd[{{1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}}]; r = raProd[{{0, 1, -1, 0}, {u1, u2, u2, u4}}];\n   {{\"(i) W_a: r.K_kappa - T_kappa/(1-kappa y)^2 == 0\", Simplify[kW[rW] - tg[{1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}]] === ConstantArray[0, 16]},\n    {\"(ii) A-frozen (0,1,-1,0)(x)(u1,u2,u2,u4): r.K^F_kappa - T_kappa/(1-kappa y)^2 == 0\", Simplify[kF[r] - tg[{0, 1, -1, 0}, {u1, u2, u2, u4}]] === ConstantArray[0, 16]},\n    {\"(iii) A-frozen with the W_a operator K_kappa: r.K_kappa == T_kappa/(1-kappa y)^2 ?\", Simplify[kW[r] - tg[{0, 1, -1, 0}, {u1, u2, u2, u4}]] === ConstantArray[0, 16]},\n    {\"(iv) W_a with K^F_kappa ?\", Simplify[kF[rW] - tg[{1, 0, 0, a}, {-a, 0, 0, 1}]] === ConstantArray[0, 16]}}];\nGrid[raSym, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
