       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[379]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{(i) W\\_a: r.K\\_kappa - T\\_kappa/(1-kappa y)\\^{}2 == 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{(ii) A-frozen (0,1,-1,0)(x)(u1,u2,u2,u4): r.K\\^{}F\\_kappa - T\\_kappa/(1-kappa y)\\^{}2 == 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{(iii) A-frozen with the W\\_a operator K\\_kappa: r.K\\_kappa == T\\_kappa/(1-kappa y)\\^{}2 ?} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\text{(iv) W\\_a with K\\^{}F\\_kappa ?} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
